Previous cursor had broken drawing (overlapping lens/handle, dotted
handle from bad perpendicular thickening). Redesigned:
- Lens: 3-radius circle (r=6,7,8) via midpoint algorithm, ~3px thick
- Handle: 3 parallel 45-degree diagonals from (17,17) to (28,29)
- Hotspot: (9,9) at lens center
